{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629550/extras/e278a44afebfea0ba0f08f78541ff4c6.avif?t=1760515920\" width=1043 height=316 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Step into the world of the Endless Palace</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BERENICE</strong> is a gothic horror roguelite where every step is a trial, and the palace around you lives its own mysterious life.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Herman</strong>, a hunter trapped inside the <strong>Endless Palace</strong>, forced to fight for survival in a world where <strong>architecture defies the laws of physics</strong> and <strong>shadows whisper thoughts that aren\u2019t yours</strong>.<br>His goal: his long-lost beloved, <strong>Berenice</strong>, whose voice echoes through a labyrinth of halls, bridges, and arches.<br>But the palace will not let him go so easily...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A procedurally endless palace</strong><br>Each section reshapes itself - there is no path to memorize. You can only move forward.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three major biomes -</strong>\u00a0Edinburgh, the Sunken City, and the Palace Vaults<br>Each with its own logic, mood, and lore-bound boss.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flexible combat and weapon builds -\u00a0</strong>Pick up, discard, adapt on the go. Every weapon has its own durability and playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive memories -</strong>Unlock fragments of the past through the journal. Control shadows. Customize the face of Berenice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A philosophical story of order, fear, and obsession -\u00a0</strong>Herman searches for peace - but the deeper he goes, the more the palace becomes him.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Audio as orientation -\u00a0</strong>Silence deceives. Hums guide. Berenice\u2019s voice calls - but where?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This isn\u2019t just a horror-action game.\u00a0</strong>It\u2019s a question:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Where do you go when the path never ends?</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629550/extras/107abbc520ba66eb4e3ac8e9c7136b0e.avif?t=1760515920\" width=1119 height=325 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Welcome to Boundless Castle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3629550/5703ef21100863902167cecc622c09d9cc48e7ec.jpg"},{"name":"Five years ago","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3629550/5703ef21100863902167cecc622c09d9cc48e7ec.jpg"},{"name":"Hello, my love","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3629550/5703ef21100863902167cecc622c09d9cc48e7ec.jpg"},{"name":"World, Absurd, Human","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3629550/5703ef21100863902167cecc622c09d9cc48e7ec.jpg"},{"name":"All town or one life?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3629550/5703ef21100863902167cecc622c09d9cc48e7ec.jpg"},{"name":"Eternal recurrence","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3629550/5703ef21100863902167cecc622c09d9cc48e7ec.jpg"},{"name":"The churchman","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3629550/5703ef21100863902167cecc622c09d9cc48e7ec.jpg"},{"name":"The song","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3629550/5703ef21100863902167cecc622c09d9cc48e7ec.jpg"},{"name":"The Hange